## Golden: move-by-default y `.clone()` (fase 3 del plan de memoria).
##
## El `.c` debe mostrar que mover suprime el destructor del origen
## (`Label b = a;` y `a` sin `_pengu_cleanup_Label`), que asignar a un
## `Drop` libera el valor anterior antes del `=`, y que `.clone()` baja a
## `_pengu_deepclone_Label(&(x))`. Cualquier cambio en el movimiento o en la
## copia profunda se ve aquí.
import std.spark

rune Label derive Drop:
    name as string
    weight as int

antiquus own_str with s as string into string:
    r"""
    return pengu_string_copy(s);
    """

weave make_label with n as int into Label:
    return with name is (calling own_str with "L{n}"), weight is n

weave main into int:
    var a as Label is calling make_label with 1
    var b as Label is a
    var c as Label is calling b.clone
    var d as Label is calling make_label with 2
    set d is calling make_label with 3
    calling d.drop
    calling spark.println with "{c.weight}{b.weight}{d.weight}"
    return 0
